SUMMARY:Reflecting the Sacred Gatherings (Zoom)
DESCRIPTION:Join Revs. Katrina and Leah for brief midweek pauses\, with music\, prayers\, and opportunity to reflect on the sacred around us during Advent. No preparation required. You may wish to go deeper with a journal available at church and suggested devotional ‘Everything is Sacred’ by Richard Rohr and Patrick Boland.
